From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arvind Oruganti <aoruganti@microsoft.com>
Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 16:46:05 +0530
Subject: Restore CodeQL warning fixes reverted by ICU 78 upstream import
 (re-apply #153)

Commit ba289fd3 ('Fixed CodeQL warnings (#153)') fixed 35 CodeQL findings across 23 files (tests, shipping common/ code, and tools). It was a direct commit, never recorded in icu-patches/, so the ICU 78 upstream source import (73bd9be6) silently reverted it. This re-applies those fixes onto the ICU 78 tree (22 files; wrtxml.cpp already carried the fix upstream). Optical-modernization conflicts (NULL->nullptr, C-casts->static_cast, UChar->char16_t) were resolved to the modern form plus the original logical fix.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

